[IMPLEMENTATION-GAPS]
UID: GAPS

GAP_001: Dual-issue pairing rules enforcement
Status: NOT IMPLEMENTED
Impact: Scheduler doesn't prevent invalid instruction pairings
Requirement: Extract pairing rules from manual and implement in scheduler
Certification: Blocks CERT-001 (Complete Pipeline Scheduling Model)

GAP_002: SU0-only instruction restrictions
Status: NOT IMPLEMENTED  
Impact: Scheduler may incorrectly allow SU1 for SU0-only instructions
Requirement: Extract SU0-only list from manual and add resource constraints
Certification: Blocks CERT-001

GAP_003: FPR/SPEFSCR save/restore code generation
Status: PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED
  - Detection logic: ✓ Added
  - Flag support: ✓ Added
  - Prologue code generation: ✗ Missing
  - Epilogue code generation: ✗ Missing
Impact: Interrupt handlers using FPU will corrupt FPR state
Requirement: Implement mfspr/mtspr for SPEFSCR, stfs/stfd for FPRs in emitPrologue/emitEpilogue
Certification: Blocks CERT-003 (Interrupt Handler Context Save)

GAP_004: Complete scheduling model
Status: INCOMPLETE (CompleteModel = 0)
Impact: WCET analysis cannot be fully validated
Requirement: Extract all timing information from manual and validate
Certification: Blocks CERT-001

